WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.820
Hey bozo. Are you ready from my stylish moves?

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.000
My spinner's razor-sharp!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.480
500 spins a minute!

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.320
1,000 SPM!

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.640
I-- impossible!

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:50.420
He's the perfect spinner.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.160
Heartless.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.400
Soulless.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.440
I paid a lot to make him, and I'm going to win it all back once we take the grand prize.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.280
I've sacrificed a lot to get here

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:12.560
Now, if I have this figured out, this competition is all about speed

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:16.000
and I've been practicing
all week!

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.400
What?! Why is the crowd booing?

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.460
Dabbing... it's not cool anymore.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:30.420
This is the last opponent standing between me and

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.360
$100 in prize money. He doesn't stand a chance!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.960
He's lighting the crowd on fire!

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.500
If I want to win, I'm going to need to focus.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:57.660
It all started two years after the accident.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:00.960
Brother!

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:09.380
They said my little brother would never walk again, but if I had $100 I could buy him some new bones.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.880
Wait a minute...
that spin...

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.660
I've seen it before..

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:35.040
And now you finally know the truth.
The one who ruined your brother's life was me.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.040
It was you!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.800
There's no way I can win, not with this spinner.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.220
But I still have one more trick up my sleeve.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.640
Professor Okinawa made me promise to destroy it.
I'm gonna have to break that promise.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.360
These psycho crystals could drive me insane.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.300
It's my only shot at redemption.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.600
Little brother, this is for you!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.700
I can't get a measure on it!
He's off the spectrum!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.200
We have a new champion!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.940
Hold on, little brother.
I'm getting you some new bones!

